## File Structure (New Files)

```
src/
├── app/
│   ├── diary/page.tsx          ← Main diary view
│   └── api/og-preview/route.ts ← Link preview fetcher
├── components/diary/
│   ├── DiaryEntryCard.tsx      ← Paper-texture entry card
│   ├── MediaPanel.tsx          ← Left/right surround panels
│   ├── HoverMediaPreview.tsx   ← Animated media popup
│   ├── ConnectionOverlay.tsx   ← SVG arc connections
│   └── PageScanner.tsx         ← Camera + AI scan UI
├── hooks/
│   ├── usePageScanner.ts       ← Scan pipeline state machine
│   └── useConnections.ts       ← Fetch entry connections
├── lib/
│   ├── supabase.ts             ← Supabase client
│   ├── db.ts                   ← CRUD helpers
│   └── cv/
│       ├── pageScanner.ts      ← OpenCV.js page crop
│       └── sketchDetector.ts   ← Contour-based sketch detection
└── types/
    └── database.ts             ← Full DB TypeScript types
supabase/
└── schema.sql                  ← SQL to run in Supabase dashboard
```

