## Tech Stack (Zero Cost)

| Purpose | Tool | Cost |
|---------|------|------|
| Framework | Next.js 16 App Router | Free |
| Database | Supabase free tier | Free |
| File storage | Supabase Storage (1GB free) | Free |
| Edge AI (page scan) | OpenCV.js (WASM, in-browser) | Free / Offline |
| Edge AI (sketch detect) | OpenCV.js contour detection | Free / Offline |
| Animations | Framer Motion | Free |
| Deployment | Vercel (hobby plan) | Free |

> **Future scaling:** Supabase is open-source and self-hostable. The schema is simple and extensible — add auth, public sharing, or collaborators without a rewrite.
